blurb: The South Portland Board of Education unanimously approved the FY25 Superintendent's
  Budget, which features a 5% operating increase and a 3.82% mill rate increase. The
  board also discussed the continuation of the Extended Learning Opportunities program
  through a partnership with JMG and approved a minor revision to the 2024-2025 school
  calendar.
